# Line endings are normalised to LF everywhere.
#
# Without this, Git for Windows converts tracked files to CRLF on checkout,
# Prettier (which expects LF) then reports every one of them as badly
# formatted, and `pnpm verify` fails for a reason that has nothing to do with
# the code. Committing this file makes the working tree match the repository on
# every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.hbc binary
